  "bodyHash": "cffec1dd5f164064",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TerraformersMC/Terrestria/f2d93cc7fc09f26a0e8650702fa43e2cc59ef8d0/banners/Terrestria-full-2.0.0.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Terrestria是一款基于Fabric模组加载器的《我的世界》细节丰富、色彩鲜艳的生态群系模组。Terrestria通过新增17个主要生态群系（辅以24个子群系）、9种新木材类型以及丰富的植被种类，极大地丰富了游戏体验，为你带来耳目一新的地形景观。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Terrestria需要<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252fuse%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TerraformersMC/Terrestria/f2d93cc7fc09f26a0e8650702fa43e2cc59ef8d0/banners/fabric-logo.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\"> Fabric Loader</a></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">请注意，旧版Terrestria需要单独下载<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>，但现在所需依赖已内置于Terrestria中。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>欢迎加入<a href=\"https://discord.gg/jEGF5fb\" rel=\"nofollow\">Terraformers Discord服务器</a>，与大家一起交流Terrestria及其他Fabric模组！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>访问<a href=\"https://github.com/TerraformersMC/Terrestria/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">Terrestria Wiki</a>了解更多关于各生态群系的详情吧！</strong></p>\n<p>Terrestria的目标是打造一款最为精致、视觉效果最佳的《我的世界》生态群系模组。为此，我们倾注了大量心血进行筛选、细化与打磨，直至呈现令人惊叹的画面。与其堆砌大量同质化的群系，我们更倾向于精雕细琢少数几个核心群系，并通过丰富的细节与子群系加以填充。这使得整体体验相比现有的群系模组更加和谐统一。</p>\n<h4 style=\"font-size:18px;text-align:left\"><strong>生态群系：</strong></h4>\n<h5 style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>v1.0.0 - 初始发布</strong></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/TerraformersMC/Terrestria/wiki/Caldera\" rel=\"nofollow\">破火山口</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/TerraformersMC/Terrestria/wiki/Cypress-Forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">柏木林</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/TerraformersMC/Terrestria/wiki/Cypress-Swamp\" rel=\"nofollow\">柏木沼泽</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/TerraformersMC/Terrestria/wiki/Dense-Woodlands\" rel=\"nofollow\">茂密林地</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/TerraformersMC/Terrestria/wiki/Hemlock-Rainforest\" rel=\"nofollow\">铁杉雨林</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/TerraformersMC/Terrestria/wiki/Japanese-Maple-Forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">日本枫树林</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/TerraformersMC/Terrestria/wiki/Lush-Redwood-Forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">繁茂红杉林</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/TerraformersMC/Terrestria/wiki/Rainbow-Rainforest\" rel=\"nofollow\">彩虹雨林</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/TerraformersMC/Terrestria/wiki/Redwood-Forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">红杉林</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/TerraformersMC/Terrestria/wiki/Sakura-Forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">樱花林</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/TerraformersMC/Terrestria/wiki/Snowy-Hemlock-Forest\" rel=\"nofollow\">积雪铁杉林</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/TerraformersMC/Terrestria/wiki/Volcanic-Island\" rel=\"nofollow\">火山岛</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<h5><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>v2.0.0 - 干旱更新</strong></span></h5>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/TerraformersMC/Terrestria/wiki/Canyon\" rel=\"nofollow\">峡谷</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/TerraformersMC/Terrestria/wiki/Dunes\" rel=\"nofollow\">沙丘</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/TerraformersMC/Terrestria/wiki/Lush-Desert\" rel=\"nofollow\">繁茂沙漠</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/TerraformersMC/Terrestria/wiki/Oasis\" rel=\"nofollow\">绿洲</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/TerraformersMC/Terrestria/wiki/Outback\" rel=\"nofollow\">内陆荒野</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>部分生态群系包含变体以增加多样性</strong></p>\n<p><strong>生态群系的图片可在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terrestria/screenshots\" rel=\"nofollow\">图片页面</a>查看。</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Terraformers的其他模组：</strong></span></h4>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>试试Terrestria的姐妹模组<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/traverse\" rel=\"nofollow\">Traverse</a>：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/traverse\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TerraformersMC/Terrestria/f2d93cc7fc09f26a0e8650702fa43e2cc59ef8d0/banners/Traverse-preview-2.2.9.png\" width=\"267\" height=\"100\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">如果你追求更接近Vanilla+理念的群系搭配，Traverse将与Terrestria完美契合。它拥有许多独特且色彩丰富的生态群系，旨在拥抱简约的原版美学，而非喧宾夺主。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>探索Terraformers的下界群系扩展模组<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cinderscapes\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cinderscapes</a>：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cinderscapes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TerraformersMC/Terrestria/f2d93cc7fc09f26a0e8650702fa43e2cc59ef8d0/banners/Cinderscapes-preview-1.0.0.png\" width=\"267\" height=\"100\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Cinderscapes为下界带来了如同Terrestria在主世界那样的扩展内容。它在赋予下界更多生机与美丽的同时，也保留了其令人畏惧的氛围。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/campanion\" rel=\"nofollow\">Campanion</a>，你的露营伙伴：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/campanion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TerraformersMC/Terrestria/f2d93cc7fc09f26a0e8650702fa43e2cc59ef8d0/banners/Campanion-preview-1.0.0.png\" width=\"267\" height=\"100\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Campanion添加了多种工具与实用功能，助你在离家冒险时更加得心应手。该模组同样能与Terrestria良好配合，让探索生态群系的旅程充满乐趣。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Terrestria是一款专为Fabric打造的模组，目前暂无移植至Forge的计划。</strong></span></p>",
